1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:03,506
(Sheldon:)- Do you know what that is?
- Of course not.

2
00:00:04,674 --> 00:00:09,874
(Sheldon:)Homeostasis refers to a system's ability
to regulate its internal environment.

3
00:00:10,046 --> 00:00:14,916
Yeah, and maintain a constant condition
of properties like temperature or pH.

4
00:00:15,118 --> 00:00:17,848
(Penny:)Worst bedtime story ever.

5
00:00:19,989 --> 00:00:23,389
(Sheldon:)My point is,
I don't like when things change.

6
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:27,930
(Sheldon:)So, regardless of your feelings, I would
like you to continue dating Leonard.

7
00:00:29,732 --> 00:00:33,222
(Sheldon:)And also, while we're on the subject,
you recently changed your shampoo.

8
00:00:33,403 --> 00:00:35,773
(Sheldon:)I'm not comfortable
with the new scent.

9
00:00:36,406 --> 00:00:39,346
Will you please stop this madness
and go back to green apple?

10
00:00:41,377 --> 00:00:43,437
(Penny:)Okay, honey, I have a lot to figure out.

11
00:00:43,646 --> 00:00:46,916
(Penny:)And until I do,
you are not to say a word to Leonard.

12
00:00:47,083 --> 00:00:50,243
(Penny:)- Do you understand?
- I do.

13
00:00:50,587 --> 00:00:58,027
(Sheldon:)- You clear on the shampoo issue?
- Get out.

